n: 4.5.5
name: three-areas-share-structures
kind: finding
is: The three areas share structures: the witness of the object model is the capability of the boundary; the allocation mark in a choice-point frame is a region; a store snapshot is an identifier; and tabling and specialisation caches are both memo tables keyed by content addresses.
status: inferred
